#: ../../quickstart.md:1 68a2448c7f98465fb1a4b04ded1f671f
msgid "🚀 Quickstart"
msgstr "🚀 快速开始"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3 db0132817baa4871a43369584f6912b8
msgid "This page shows how to start using Bookshelf. Like it? Star on [GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf) or follow on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf)."
msgstr "本页介绍如何开始使用 Bookshelf。喜欢这个项目？欢迎在 [GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf) 上点亮 Star，或在 [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf) 上关注我们。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:7 03b25b533ffc43f8a3bfe3c7caae7af0
msgid "📥 Installation"
msgstr "📥 安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md 89b7a267207548c8865e8df56e2099c9
msgid "🔌 from manager"
msgstr "🔌 通过管理器安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md:13 733b60785ca44c75b9f8ea9f4a518bec
msgid "Use the manager to make a custom bundle."
msgstr "使用管理器制作自定义捆绑包。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:15 5985f4685e604a1d9d2e9f5eb6304145
msgid "Go to [mcbookshelf.dev](https://mcbookshelf.dev)"
msgstr "前往 [mcbookshelf.dev](https://mcbookshelf.dev)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:16 4a8d79c0836641b283a0479f6b468db9
msgid "Pick your modules"
msgstr "选择你的模块"

#: ../../quickstart.md:17 acedf22c341e46069677ce5a679657e4
msgid "Review dependencies"
msgstr "检查依赖关系"

#: ../../quickstart.md:18 c7668ad5d8c648f5ac22966016631587
msgid "Download the bundle"
msgstr "下载捆绑包"

#: ../../quickstart.md:20 ../../quickstart.md:31
#: 005435b063a64a0bb2b3e047d175fd99 830545579b1849b3a1f07b194e1a716e
msgid "After downloading, move the ZIP file to your world's `datapacks` folder."
msgstr "下载后，将 ZIP 文件移至 Minecraft 世界的 `datapacks` 文件夹。"

#: ../../quickstart.md aa2203a7579d4f0aa25d3f8d04c9aac9
msgid "🏷️ from release"
msgstr "🏷️ 通过发布版本安装"

#: ../../quickstart.md:25 3df51c9980764d6c8e293f5b869e809c
msgid "Get releases from [GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases) or [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf). You can download either:"
msgstr "可从 [GitHub](https://github.com/mcbookshelf/bookshelf/releases) 或 [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/organization/mcbookshelf) 获取发布版本，并选择下载："

#: ../../quickstart.md:28 56a92353427348288b95185bafe4443a
msgid "📚 **Bundles:** groups of related modules with their dependencies"
msgstr "📚 **捆绑包：** 相关模块及其依赖项的组"

#: ../../quickstart.md:29 67570c89c48f4e28a9908337b2d6283f
msgid "🧩 **Modules:** a single module with its dependencies"
msgstr "🧩 **模块：** 单个模块及其依赖项"

#: ../../quickstart.md b9f5e79237ce4c43a6a24e6a4fcb25fe
msgid "🐍 from PyPI, with Beet"
msgstr "🐍 通过 PyPI 安装，配合 Beet 使用"

#: ../../quickstart.md:36 359e6a2d9cb2427ab1c263c8114b9488
msgid "If you use the [beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet) pipeline, install `mcbookshelf` from PyPI:"
msgstr "如果你使用 [beet](https://github.com/mcbeet/beet) 构建流程，请从 PyPI 安装 `mcbookshelf`："

#: ../../quickstart.md:41 d642c9ebb2d24a28b87b54f943c7f8c4
msgid "Then, reference Bookshelf bundles or modules in your beet config:"
msgstr "然后，在 beet 配置中引用 Bookshelf 捆绑包或模块："

#: ../../quickstart.md:43 82e7c85a6fb54dbfa7049ce848369518
msgid "beet.yml"
msgstr "beet.yml"

#: ../../quickstart.md 9de7a15a6da24229814f0c2ea7da0863
msgid "🗃️ from source"
msgstr "🗃️ 从源代码构建"

#: ../../quickstart.md:55 1f8d43b3be7c4bf3bbc522ba57e60f67
msgid "To work with the source code, you must first build Bookshelf."
msgstr "要处理源代码，你必须先构建 Bookshelf。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:57 5ce7ce66d1344ae8b0c12c8137f81bfa
msgid "🛠️ Requirements"
msgstr "🛠️ 准备工作"

#: ../../quickstart.md:59 5a1d2da913034dbba154508115eb6e56
msgid "Datapack basics"
msgstr "数据包基础"

#: ../../quickstart.md:60 02884a9fda7845339cb8ade966aa6d48
msgid "[Git](https://git-scm.com/install/) installed"
msgstr "已安装 [Git](https://git-scm.com/install/)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:61 0d4e118dd0584d6b9cf16081f337cca5
msgid "[uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) installed"
msgstr "已安装 [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:63 e5cb71cecc4a46fda8b696e1a376a858
msgid "📥 Installation steps"
msgstr "📥 安装步骤"

#: ../../quickstart.md:65 909a560f1a3643a4a775eaeba059e09f
msgid "Clone the repository:"
msgstr "克隆仓库："

#: ../../quickstart.md:71 ed4574b36ea04f12b01435a41d387967
msgid "Build the modules:"
msgstr "构建模块："

#: ../../quickstart.md:76 e22d1a3df75e4470a83cab74bdce3b00
msgid "Built modules appear in the `build` folder."
msgstr "构建的模块出现在 `build` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:81 226ec8c8f94042ccbe0fa4641ee4f1fe
msgid "Release datapacks are stable but may not be the newest. For the latest features or fixes, build from source or use a pre-release."
msgstr "发布的数据包稳定但可能不是最新的。要获取最新功能或修复，请从源代码构建或使用预发布版本。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:86 d2ef75b655af47b39f7d035290c305f2
msgid "👶 First steps"
msgstr "👶 开始使用"

#: ../../quickstart.md:88 94c47e30a46241589d4c73b853642636
msgid "Run this command to check the installation:"
msgstr "运行此命令以检查安装："

#: ../../quickstart.md:94 38604e9c18144ea39db8444e9d384d82
msgid "This lists loaded modules and checks for compatibility issues. If you need help installing a datapack, see [this guide](https://datapack.wiki/guide/installing-a-datapack)."
msgstr "该命令会列出已加载的模块并检查兼容性问题。如果你还不熟悉数据包安装，可以参考[这篇指南](https://datapack.wiki/guide/installing-a-datapack)。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:96 96c2e487564d455884e6c4e0e3aaf248
msgid "From there, you can explore the documentation for individual modules, try out examples, and start integrating their functionality into your own projects!"
msgstr "确认安装正常后，你可以浏览各个模块的文档、尝试示例，并将所需功能逐步接入自己的项目。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:99 ef059673bf2a4c26a275d1ad1bc19c32
msgid "Bookshelf uses persistent entities. Avoid `kill @e`, use `kill @e[tag=!bs.persistent]` instead. [Learn more](contribute/shared-resources.md#entities)"
msgstr "Bookshelf 使用持久化实体。请勿执行 `kill @e`，应改用 `kill @e[tag=!bs.persistent]`。[了解更多](contribute/shared-resources.md#entities)"

#: ../../quickstart.md:100 abf31be4f979434fbb0f512f6fa99ab1
msgid "Side effects are rare, but conflicts can occur if multiple datapacks use the same functions. Always set inputs before running a function."
msgstr "Bookshelf 通常不会影响其他数据包，但多个数据包调用同一函数时仍可能发生冲突。请务必先设置输入，再运行函数。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:103 74fed58dec504017b71277a7fafa546a
msgid "Next, check out the [modules](modules/index.md) documentation to see each module in detail and learn how to use them."
msgstr "接下来，可以查看[模块](modules/index.md)文档，了解各个模块的用途和使用方法。"

#: ../../quickstart.md:106 2d52f521aad549e7b08ae66977ae1668
msgid "This section is in progress. If you have ideas to improve it, share them on the [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) server."
msgstr "本节仍在完善中。如果你有改进建议，欢迎在 [Discord](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) 服务器中提出。"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:4 544b70f7939e485ca715a7f2d5f3b364
msgid "**💬 Did it help you?**"
msgstr "**💬 这对你有帮助吗？**"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:6 3412ec96fd4a4e67877749b4afa61c0c
msgid "Feel free to leave your questions and feedback below!"
msgstr "欢迎在下方留下你的问题和反馈！"

#~ msgid "[Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) and [PDM](https://pdm.fming.dev/latest/) (Python Dependency Manager) installed"
#~ msgstr "已安装 [Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) 和 [PDM](https://pdm.fming.dev/latest/)（Python 依赖管理器）"

#~ msgid "Install dependencies:"
#~ msgstr "安装依赖："

#~ msgid "This page gives a quick overview of how to get started with the Bookshelf library, and how to use it."
#~ msgstr "本页面简要介绍如何开始使用 Bookshelf 库及其使用方法。"

#~ msgid "The [Bookshelf Manager](https://mcbookshelf.dev) is the official tool for creating your own custom Bookshelf bundle."
#~ msgstr "[Bookshelf 管理器](https://mcbookshelf.dev) 是创建自定义 Bookshelf 捆绑包的官方工具。"

#~ msgid "✨ Key Benefits"
#~ msgstr "✨ 主要优势"

#~ msgid "🎯 **Precise Selection**: Choose exactly the modules you need"
#~ msgstr "🎯 **精准选择**：仅选择所需模块"

#~ msgid "📊 **Dependency Visualization**: Intuitive interface showing relationships between modules"
#~ msgstr "📊 **依赖可视化**：直观展示模块间关系的界面"

#~ msgid "🏷️ **Tag System**: Easily identify modules with tags, grouping them by purpose"
#~ msgstr "🏷️ **标签系统**：通过标签轻松识别并按用途分组模块"

#~ msgid "📥 Installation Options"
#~ msgstr "📥 安装选项"

#~ msgid "📚 **Bundles:** You can download entire bundles which includes all modules and dependencies of a certain type in a single datapack. This is a good option if you want to explore everything Bookshelf has to offer."
#~ msgstr "📚 **捆绑包：** 可下载包含特定类型所有模块和依赖项的完整捆绑包（单个数据包）。适合需要全面探索 Bookshelf 功能的用户。"

#~ msgid "🧩 **Module by Module:** Alternatively, you can download individual modules as datapacks. Each module zip file contains all the dependencies needed for that module to work. This is a great option if you only need specific functionalities and want to keep your installation lightweight."
#~ msgstr "🧩 **按模块安装：** 也可下载单个模块的数据包。每个模块压缩包包含其运行所需的所有依赖项。适合只需特定功能并希望保持安装轻量的用户。"

#~ msgid "To include a complete bundle or a specific module:"
#~ msgstr "要包含完整捆绑包或特定模块："

#~ msgid "If you're a developer who wants to work directly with the source code, you'll need to build Bookshelf before using it. This build process is necessary because some features require computed data that can't be directly included in the source code. Here's how to get started:"
#~ msgstr "开发者若需直接使用源代码，需先构建 Bookshelf。此构建过程是必要的，因为某些功能需要无法直接包含在源代码中的计算数据。开始步骤如下："

#~ msgid "🛠️ Prerequisites"
#~ msgstr "🛠️ 先决条件"

#~ msgid "Basic understanding of datapacks"
#~ msgstr "基本了解数据包"

#~ msgid "Git (for cloning the repository)"
#~ msgstr "Git（用于克隆仓库）"

#~ msgid "After building, you'll find all modules as datapacks in the `build` folder. Each module includes its own dependencies as well as some utility namespaces."
#~ msgstr "构建完成后，所有模块将作为数据包存放在 `build` 文件夹中。每个模块包含其依赖项及实用命名空间。"

#~ msgid "Note"
#~ msgstr "注意"

#~ msgid "Please note that while the datapacks from releases are stable, they might not include the very latest features or fixes that are available in the source code. If you want the most up-to-date version of Bookshelf, consider installing from source or downloading a pre-release from GitHub."
#~ msgstr "请注意，发布版本的数据包虽稳定，但可能不包含源代码中的最新功能或修复。如需最新版 Bookshelf，建议通过源代码安装或从 Github 下载预发布版本。"

#~ msgid "📖 Good Practices"
#~ msgstr "📖 最佳实践"

#~ msgid "Bookshelf is designed to minimize unintended side effects. However, complications can arise when multiple datapacks utilize the same one. To prevent potential issues, it's always recommended to set inputs prior to executing a function. This holds true even though Bookshelf adheres to a strict policy of preserving inputs. By following this practice, you can ensure smoother operation and prevent unexpected behaviors."
#~ msgstr "Bookshelf 的设计目标是最大程度减少非预期影响。但当多个数据包使用相同功能时，仍可能引发冲突。为预防潜在问题，建议始终在执行函数前设置输入值。即使 Bookshelf 遵循严格的输入保留策略，这一实践依然适用。遵循此操作规范可确保运行更顺畅，并避免意外行为。"
